==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|baseball}} The [[infield]] defensive [[player]] that stands between the [[second baseman]] and the [[third baseman]].
#: ''The '''shortstop''' ranged deep into the hole to make the stop.''
# {{label|en|figuratively}} A nimble defender.
#: ''I'll play '''shortstop''' when we make our proposal.''

